# Makes `domicile-open-url.desktop` the default web link handler. GIO and
# `xdg-open` read this file only when `XDG_CURRENT_DESKTOP` is `domicile`, and
# `domicile` puts the package's `share` first in every app's `XDG_DATA_DIRS`.
# A user's own `mimeapps.list` still takes precedence.
[Default Applications]
text/html=domicile-open-url.desktop
x-scheme-handler/http=domicile-open-url.desktop
x-scheme-handler/https=domicile-open-url.desktop
